  "doc.title": "What Travels Through Empty Space · An Essay You Can Play With",
  "doc.desc": "With neither air nor wires in empty space, what carries signals across the void? Ten interactive first-principles physics models: delayed field lines, displacement current and Maxwell's equations, 1-D Yee FDTD electromagnetic waves, Larmor and dipole radiation, Poynting flux and radiation pressure, polarization, the full spectrum and the quantum boundary, atmospheric windows, link budgets, phased arrays, and 2026 frontiers.",
